{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"58312901eab3ff21","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/1.05-To Know.md","x":240,"y":-1020,"width":480,"height":560},
		{"id":"e26c26cd25ef8ca2","type":"text","text":"- [ ] add Sara's job, at least that she has one. ","x":880,"y":-820,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"e6b6718f6cb065d2","type":"text","text":"At first, Jane wanted to use a birth control option. They use a barrier method for a while. Sara had already experimented with hormonal birth control in the past, but instead of the performance stabilization many other female athletes saw, it caused major issues for her. Including interfering with weight management, making it impossible at times for her to choose what weight class she completed in. Thankfully, Jane had been so understanding about that part. \"It's fine, not everyone can do hormonal birth control. It's your body, it's up to you.\" She'd said. Sara had smiled, happy to have Jane in her corner. It was something she grew to really enjoy about their relationship: how much Jane loved her just as she was. Not that Sara would want Jane to change, but it made Sara happy that the feeling was mutual. It was so common that people expected Sara to be something other than what she was, it was why she had acted out some much as a teen. Sara had made peace with how she didn't fit society's norms, but it was still refreshing to have someone in her life who loved her exactly how she was. \n\nThough once they were married, Sara really didn't see the point. One time, that barrier method was giving them trouble, and Sara couldn't help but point out, \"You know, that really isn't necessary. I'm fine if we don't use it.\" \n\nJane looked at her, \"Really? You sure?\" \n\nUnfortunately Sara was sure it redundant, \"Yeah,\" it wasn't like she would get pregnant either way. The thought made kind of sad and hurt. To cover those feelings, she pulled Jane close and whispered in her ear, \"I'm sure I want to touch you.\" When Jane moaned in response, Sara kissed her neck. ","x":292,"y":-319,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"9f631c083d918d2d","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/1.04-To Date Or Not To Date.md","x":-460,"y":-1260,"width":590,"height":640},
		{"id":"fdc87e42a425604d","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/1.03-Art Galleries.md","x":-365,"y":-1800,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"a765c678b54cc0aa","type":"text","text":"- [ ] Add scenes at the gym, like with Don. Maybe like him giving Sara tips. Days where Sara shows up pissed and just wants to punch really hard. ","x":-1000,"y":-1460,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"5468a214a5240c08","type":"file","file":"Sims4-Yootz-Story/Part_01/1.01-Move In.md","x":-1800,"y":-1460,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"320b2f99d3b119e9","type":"text","text":"Maybe Jane makes pancakes and offers to share, but Sara's like no thanks, way too many carbs not enough protein. But thanks for the offer. And makes something with eggs. \n\nOr just like thanks for the offer, but I really got to get some protein in me. ","x":-1680,"y":-940,"width":400,"height":400},
		{"id":"d6cceee3c19b897b","x":-1140,"y":-700,"width":400,"height":400,"type":"text","text":"# Can I hang a painting here? \n\nI have the part where Jane asked to hang a painting on the wall, and either like have this happen multiple times or like establish in the scene that like this was the fifth time this week Jane had asked if she could hang a painting in a particular spot, so Sarah was just like look you can hang any painting you want anywhere you want in the entire house I'm fine with it it's fine I know we're sharing the house, but like you can put paintings anywhere I'm good with any painting in any spot it's fine. "}
